      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ludlow%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Ludlow Co‑Op Elevator Company, founded in 1904, still serves the community and now operates eleven locations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
