      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ludlow%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Ludlow Grade School, a public elementary school serving kindergarten through eighth grade, is the village’s only school.",
